      "body": "The existing `paths-ignore` still suppresses this workflow for docs-only pushes. That leaves some experiment-branch SHAs without the exact-SHA push run required for authoritative validation of every increment; remove this filter for these protected branch pushes (or move them to a separate unfiltered workflow)."
